# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# DuckDB database file and raw data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The .duckdb file is rebuilt from raw CSVs + dbt models on every run,
# so there's no reason to version it. Raw CSVs are re-fetchable from the
# ECB API. If you ever want to commit a small debugging sample, use an
# override like:  !data/raw/sample_*.csv
data/ecb_analytics.duckdb
data/ecb_analytics.duckdb.wal
data/raw/*.csv

